mdglass (0.1.0-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The window draws ```mermaid blocks and untyped box-art blocks as vector
    pictures (aasvg + mermaid-rs-renderer in-process, an installed mmdr CLI
    as second opinion); anything that cannot be drawn stays a code block.
    Terminal output is unchanged.

 -- Rafal Okninski <hpn777@gmail.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 14:22:36 +0000

mdglass (0.1.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GNOME preview: tables and diagrams keep their shape (pixel-exact columns
    for CJK and emoji, wide blocks scroll sideways instead of wrapping);
    prose is wrapped to the window; colors follow the light/dark theme.
  * Position and find match survive zoom, resize and reload; horizontal
    rules are drawn; code inside quotes keeps its shading.

 -- Rafal Okninski <hpn777@gmail.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 12:38:11 +0000

mdglass (0.1.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from mdv (that name is taken on crates.io and PyPI); the
    application ID is now io.github.hpn777.MdGlass.
  * AppStream metainfo; Recommends the GTK4/libadwaita libraries the GNOME
    preview loads at runtime.

